2
00:00:07,010 --> 00:00:13,490
Stilt house is type of house of ethnic groups living where?

3
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:17,940
Choose correct answer:

4
00:00:18,180 --> 00:00:24,060
A. Northwest region.

5
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:28,800
B. Central Highlands region.

6
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:33,740
C. Mekong Delta region.

7
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:47,210
Answer: B. Stilt house is type of house of ethnic groups living in Central Highlands region.

8
00:00:47,890 --> 00:01:00,940
Stilt house is usually made of what? Choose suitable word saying material usually used to make stilt house.

9
00:01:02,010 --> 00:01:04,810
iron

10
00:01:05,520 --> 00:01:08,320
wood

11
00:01:08,850 --> 00:01:10,600
cement

12
00:01:13,460 --> 00:01:20,200
Answer: Stilt house is usually made of wood.

13
00:01:20,520 --> 00:01:29,730
What are characteristics of stilt house? Mark X before suitable words saying characteristics of stilt house.

14
00:01:30,400 --> 00:01:31,930
low

15
00:01:32,460 --> 00:01:35,120
not sturdy

16
00:01:35,880 --> 00:01:37,740
high

17
00:01:38,420 --> 00:01:40,480
sturdy

18
00:01:42,900 --> 00:01:48,040
Answer: high and sturdy.

19
00:01:48,460 --> 00:01:53,300
Middle compartment of stilt house is used for what?

20
00:01:53,650 --> 00:01:57,700
Choose correct answers:

21
00:01:58,160 --> 00:02:04,930
A. Village spirit worship place.

22
00:02:05,620 --> 00:02:13,280
B. Place village elders often gather to discuss important matters.

23
00:02:13,890 --> 00:02:20,800
C. Village guest reception place.

24
00:02:21,460 --> 00:02:29,560
D. Centralized sleeping place of village boys from 16 years old.

25
00:02:31,730 --> 00:02:36,440
Answer: B and C.

26
00:02:36,770 --> 00:02:50,160
Middle compartment of stilt house is place village elders often gather to discuss important matters and this is also village guest reception place.

